  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Food Programme (WFP) &#x2013; Nutritional programme for moderately acutely malnourished children under -5, pregnant and lactating women; and the piloting of a cash based system for providing food for refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity World Food Programme (WFP) &#x2013; Nutritional programme for moderately acutely malnourished children under -5, pregnant and lactating women; and the piloting of a cash based system for providing food for refugees is a component of Support for Refugees in Kenya (2012-2016) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;16,725,000. It works in the following sector(s): Emergency food assistance, Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
